# OpenRouter API Configuration
# 
# Get a free API key from: https://openrouter.ai
# - Sign up (free, no credit card required)
# - Generate an API key from your dashboard
# - Paste it below
#
# The app uses free open-source models:
# - Primary: nvidia/nemotron-3-nano-30b-a3b:free (fast, capable)
# - Backup: google/gemma-3-4b-it:free (fallback if primary unavailable)
# 
# To use this file:
# 1. Copy this file: cp server/.env.example server/.env
# 2. Edit server/.env and replace the placeholder with your actual API key
# 3. Start the server: npm start

OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-your_actual_api_key_here
